  "display_fullname": "Rikti Rikti Kong Mechanics Monkey ShieldCall",
  "display_help": "If K'ong is below 100% HP, he will automatically begin conjuring forth his horde of Rikti Monkeys from the containment barrels placed in the room. If K'ong is undamaged, all spawned Rikti Monkeys will despawn.<br><br>These spawn in set waves every 15 seconds, and if too many spawn, the gas pressure in the room become high! Ensure the amount of Rikti Monkeys in the room stays below twenty-five to ensure the gas pressure stays low.<br><br>K'ong cannot be damaged unless special Rikti Monkeys are defeated that will periodically spawn from his barrels.",
